{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56605","headline":"闲厅晚景敬呈徐长史 · 赵志","name":"闲厅晚景敬呈徐长史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日下桒榆，暝烟起林薄。\n砌闲来狎鸟，檐空多噪雀。\n旅思独栖遑，心事两睽索。\n寂寞无兴晤，徘徊何托。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}